WEBVTT

00:00:15.333 --> 00:00:18.292
Have you ever had a premonition about death?

00:00:19.625 --> 00:00:22.500
A premonition about death?

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.125
When I was less experienced,

00:00:24.125 --> 00:00:28.333
and either the previous dark general
or the one before him easily defeated me,

00:00:28.333 --> 00:00:31.750
I thought that might be it for me.

00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:35.458
But you brought back his head
quite some time ago.

00:00:35.458 --> 00:00:38.250
You haven't had any since?

00:00:39.583 --> 00:00:41.875
You know, I can't really remember.

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:44.458
But why would you ask me that so unexpectedly?

00:00:44.458 --> 00:00:47.542
Surely Your Eminence is free of such sensations.

00:00:47.542 --> 00:00:50.625
You don't understand, do you, Bercouli?

00:00:50.625 --> 00:00:55.125
It's every day. Every day, I sense death.

00:00:55.125 --> 00:00:57.500
Every morning when I open my eyes...

00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:00.542
No, even in my dreams.

00:01:00.542 --> 00:01:05.000
And why is that?
Because I still don't control everything.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:07.833
Because I have enemies who are still alive.

00:01:07.833 --> 00:01:16.125
And because the possibility of a new enemy emerging
at some point in the future is always looming.

00:01:16.125 --> 00:01:18.500
Well, well...

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:23.042
Being the pontifex certainly isn't easy, huh?

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:31.708
Your Eminence...

00:01:31.708 --> 00:01:36.083
I think I finally understand
what you meant now.

00:03:11.042 --> 00:03:15.042
"Heartless Choice"

00:03:17.167 --> 00:03:19.208
Here, Senpai.

00:03:30.458 --> 00:03:35.417
You look a bit healthier today, Kirito-<i>senpai</i>.

00:03:35.417 --> 00:03:38.500
And you have a good appetite!

00:03:39.542 --> 00:03:43.958
Perhaps sleeping beside
four beauties did him good!

00:03:57.333 --> 00:03:59.042
I see.

00:03:59.042 --> 00:04:03.417
The enemy from the real world
really has some unique strategies.

00:04:03.417 --> 00:04:07.292
Emperor Vecta is taking a risk.

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:18.083
This is war.

00:04:19.083 --> 00:04:26.042
Unlike the outsider, little Asuna, this is no time
for us to feel sorry for the forces of darkness.

00:04:26.042 --> 00:04:28.042
We have to take this chance.

00:04:28.042 --> 00:04:28.833
Chance?

00:04:28.833 --> 00:04:30.458
That's right.

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:43.958
Hurry! Hurry! Hurry!

00:04:54.708 --> 00:04:59.458
Have your people climb across ropes
cast over the chasm to reach the other side.

00:04:59.458 --> 00:05:02.000
I don't care if there are casualties.

00:05:03.208 --> 00:05:07.167
You're to enforce the tightrope
walking no matter what.

00:05:07.167 --> 00:05:08.625
They're dying in vain!

00:05:08.625 --> 00:05:13.750
Not for the five tribes of darkness's long-cherished
goal, the invasion of the Human Empire...

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:17.375
...but for something called
the Priestess of Light!

00:05:17.375 --> 00:05:19.625
Hurry! Hurry up!

00:05:19.625 --> 00:05:24.125
Before something else comes to get in your way!
Just make it over, all of you!

00:05:49.042 --> 00:05:52.125
Enemy attack! Protect them!
Protect those ropes at all costs!

00:05:52.125 --> 00:05:55.417
They're only a small force!
Don't let them get near the ropes!

00:06:08.083 --> 00:06:10.208
Stop!

00:06:17.458 --> 00:06:21.083
So this... So this is war, huh?

00:06:21.083 --> 00:06:24.083
How can you call this a battle?

00:06:24.083 --> 00:06:31.083
No way did they endure all that grueling
training just to die like this!

00:06:34.667 --> 00:06:38.750
Forgive me. Forgive me, all right?

00:06:43.292 --> 00:06:49.833
Just as I suspected, the AI of the Human
Empire units appear to be slightly superior.

00:06:49.833 --> 00:06:51.375
No.

00:06:51.375 --> 00:06:56.083
Strictly in terms of adaptability,
they're in a different class.

00:06:56.083 --> 00:06:58.917
Don't mess up, Critter.

00:07:01.167 --> 00:07:03.708
"Tuesday, July 7, 2026 12:05 AM Ocean Turtle

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:10.208
Syncing of the Underworld
and the real world times is complete!

00:07:19.125 --> 00:07:20.958
What?

00:07:20.958 --> 00:07:23.667
Hey, is this for real?

00:07:23.667 --> 00:07:29.292
Are they crazy? A PvP with life-like
human avatars AND realistic violence?

00:07:29.292 --> 00:07:33.125
You mean we can like,
cut off arms and heads and stuff? No way!

00:07:33.125 --> 00:07:37.792
No restrictions? Hell to the yes!
The developer is adventurous!

00:07:37.792 --> 00:07:41.542
I'm so signing up for this beta!

00:07:41.542 --> 00:07:44.833
I'll let you have the dark knight accounts.

00:07:44.833 --> 00:07:49.167
Go on and massacre the Human Empire Army
to your heart's content!

00:08:01.042 --> 00:08:02.458
Oh, no!

00:08:02.458 --> 00:08:05.792
Daddy and Mommy are in danger!

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:10.417
"Tuesday, July 7, 2026 3:02 AM Shino's apartment

00:08:17.833 --> 00:08:19.042
"Incoming Call"
"Kazuto Kirigaya"

00:08:20.917 --> 00:08:22.792
Sinon! It's Yui!

00:08:22.792 --> 00:08:24.333
Y-Yui?

00:08:24.333 --> 00:08:25.875
I'll explain later!

00:08:25.875 --> 00:08:29.625
Get ready to go out right now,
leave your apartment, and get into a taxi!

00:08:29.625 --> 00:08:33.250
I'm sending the address and the fastest
route to get there to your phone!

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:35.500
A-A taxi? To where?

00:08:35.500 --> 00:08:37.667
Please hurry! Daddy and Mommy are in danger!

00:08:37.667 --> 00:08:39.542
"Tuesday, July 7, 2026 3:02 AM
Kirigaya residence"

00:08:41.125 --> 00:08:44.833
Um... can you take me to Minato Ward
in Tokyo, please?

00:08:46.583 --> 00:08:51.792
Sorry, Mom. I promise
that I'll rescue Big Brother, okay?

00:09:09.292 --> 00:09:13.750
It's already been ten hours since Ms. Asuna
logged into the Underworld, huh?

00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:17.375
Which means that about a year
should have gone by over there.

00:09:20.542 --> 00:09:25.667
Was the World End's Altar that far
from the Human Empire?

00:09:26.875 --> 00:09:28.958
M-Mr. Kiku! The phone!

00:09:30.042 --> 00:09:32.542
Sub Control Room. This is Kikuoka.

00:09:32.542 --> 00:09:37.333
U-Uh, that's the Rath main location
STL Development headquarters, right?

00:09:37.333 --> 00:09:42.333
This is Hiraki at the Roppongi Branch.
We have a problem, or should I say,

00:09:42.333 --> 00:09:44.625
something odd is going on.

00:09:44.625 --> 00:09:48.333
Someone from outside Rath just showed up
without an appointment.

00:09:48.333 --> 00:09:51.250
Outside? You mean clients?

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:54.208
No. It has nothing at all to do with clients.

00:09:54.208 --> 00:09:57.500
And they don't look to be anything
but high school girls.

00:09:57.500 --> 00:09:59.917
And there's two of them.

00:09:59.917 --> 00:10:01.708
D-Did you say high school girls?

00:10:01.708 --> 00:10:02.625
Yes.

00:10:02.625 --> 00:10:07.417
And they asked me to contact Seijiro Kikuoka
of Rath headquarters right now,

00:10:07.417 --> 00:10:13.375
to tell you to check
the Underworld FLA rate immediately.

00:10:17.333 --> 00:10:20.458
I-It's the same? Since when?

00:10:20.458 --> 00:10:23.583
N-Names! Did those girls give their names?

00:10:23.917 --> 00:10:27.625
"Tuesday, July 7, 2026 4:34 AM
Rath Roppongi branch"
Uh, yes! Actually...
This is going to sound crazy, too, but...

00:10:27.625 --> 00:10:30.583
There's no way it's their real names.

00:10:30.583 --> 00:10:36.833
Uh, let's see. They told me to tell you
that it's "Sinon" and "Leafa."

00:10:36.833 --> 00:10:40.292
I mean, they look totally Japanese to me, but...

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:47.125
"Tuesday, July 7, 2026 4:40 AM
ALO New Aincrad Floor 22"

00:10:47.125 --> 00:10:48.542
"Tuesday, July 7, 2026 4:40 AM
ALO New Aincrad Floor 22"
For crying out loud.

00:10:48.542 --> 00:10:53.792
Damn him, he had to go off on his own
and get mixed up in some trouble again?

00:10:53.792 --> 00:11:00.083
A virtual world created by the SDF,
and an honest-to-goodness AI named Alice?

00:11:00.083 --> 00:11:04.458
But that's so beyond the realm of a game!

00:11:04.458 --> 00:11:08.958
Not only that, but they're going to load her
into a fighter jet and make her wage war?

00:11:08.958 --> 00:11:11.917
Apparently, for now,
Rath intends to use that technology

00:11:11.917 --> 00:11:16.542
in demonstrations both
omestically and internationally.

00:11:16.542 --> 00:11:20.250
But my guess is that the attackers
occupying the Ocean Turtle

00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:25.542
have a more specific application in mind.

00:11:25.542 --> 00:11:29.458
Who the heck are these attackers, anyway?

00:11:29.458 --> 00:11:35.375
It's extremely likely that the U.S. military
or a U.S. intelligence agency is involved.

00:11:35.375 --> 00:11:38.958
Th-The U.S. military?
You mean the American army?

00:11:38.958 --> 00:11:42.667
If Alice were to fall into the hands
of the U.S. military,

00:11:42.667 --> 00:11:49.292
in the not-so-distant future, she'd most likely
be deployed in battle as an unmanned AI weapon.

00:11:49.292 --> 00:11:53.708
I'm sure Daddy and Mommy want
to prevent that, if nothing else.

00:11:53.708 --> 00:11:55.583
Because...

00:11:55.583 --> 00:11:57.500
Because Alice...

00:11:57.500 --> 00:12:01.417
...is proof that all VRMMO worlds,
beginning with SAO,

00:12:01.417 --> 00:12:04.500
and the people who lived in them,
really existed,

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:10.458
and she's also the fruit of massive amounts
of time, material, and mental resources!

00:12:14.417 --> 00:12:21.917
I am convinced beyond a doubt that the true
objective created by the Seed package

00:12:21.917 --> 00:12:24.458
is none other than the birth of Alice.

00:12:24.458 --> 00:12:26.792
Throughout countless connected worlds,

00:12:26.792 --> 00:12:32.542
so many people have laughed,
cried, grieved, and loved

00:12:32.542 --> 00:12:34.750
and because the radiance
of their souls resonated,

00:12:34.750 --> 00:12:40.500
a new form of humanity
was born in the Underworld.

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:47.667
Daddy. Mommy. Leafa. Klein.
Lisbeth. Silica. Agil. Sinon.

00:12:47.667 --> 00:12:54.667
As well as so many other people. It was from the
cradle woven by your hearts that Alice was born!

00:12:56.125 --> 00:12:58.708
Yeah. That's true, isn't it?

00:12:58.708 --> 00:13:01.875
We're connected to all of it.

00:13:01.875 --> 00:13:04.542
Time, people, and our hearts, too.

00:13:04.542 --> 00:13:07.167
Like a huge river.

00:13:07.167 --> 00:13:10.500
Don't worry... Yui.

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:17.333
We'll go save Kirito and Asuna.
We're definitely going to save them.

00:13:17.333 --> 00:13:19.375
So please don't cry.

00:13:19.375 --> 00:13:22.417
You heard her!
You should've come to us sooner, Yuippe!

00:13:22.417 --> 00:13:25.458
There's no way we'd ever abandon Kirito!

00:13:25.458 --> 00:13:28.333
We owe that guy big time, after all.

00:13:28.333 --> 00:13:31.000
We should pay him back a little now, at least.

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:34.500
Everyone, thank you so much!

00:13:35.458 --> 00:13:38.167
Thank you so much.

00:13:39.542 --> 00:13:46.792
Still, 30,000 VRMMO players diving
from America? It could even be 100,000.

00:13:46.792 --> 00:13:49.917
And they'll all side with the enemy
against the Human Empire, huh?

00:13:49.917 --> 00:13:56.417
What if we exposed the experiment or the attack
on the American VRMMO sites,

00:13:56.417 --> 00:14:01.333
and asked them not to take part
in the fake beta test?

00:14:01.333 --> 00:14:05.750
The reality is that this is war for a secret
between the U.S. and Japanese militaries.

00:14:05.750 --> 00:14:10.750
If we were to give off any hint of that,
it could very well backfire.

00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:16.292
Posting "Your opponents are real humans,
so please don't kill them," wouldn't help, huh?

00:14:18.083 --> 00:14:20.875
Well, then all we have to do
is take a page from their book!

00:14:20.875 --> 00:14:23.500
By making our own notification
site for the beta test.

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:26.042
If the Rath guys give us
accounts of equal level,

00:14:26.042 --> 00:14:29.917
we can drum up 30 or 40,000, just like that!

00:14:29.917 --> 00:14:33.292
But there is one problem, you know.

00:14:33.292 --> 00:14:34.958
What problem?

00:14:34.958 --> 00:14:36.625
The time difference.

00:14:36.625 --> 00:14:42.583
Right now, it's 4:30 am in Japan,
meaning the period with the fewest connections.

00:14:42.583 --> 00:14:47.583
On the other hand, in the U.S.,
it's 12:30 noon in LA, and 3:30 PM in New York.

00:14:47.583 --> 00:14:51.917
There are way more active players over there.

00:14:51.917 --> 00:14:54.500
Agil is right about that.

00:14:54.500 --> 00:15:00.000
We couldn't hope to gather
anywhere near 10,000 people right now.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:03.125
If we were to use accounts
of the same level as the enemy,

00:15:03.125 --> 00:15:07.167
our chances of holding our own
would be extremely low, I'd have to say.

00:15:07.167 --> 00:15:12.375
But aren't any more of the god account
that Asuna used, are there?

00:15:12.375 --> 00:15:16.875
Not that we have time to level up
from scratch like Kirito did.

00:15:16.875 --> 00:15:19.000
So it's game over, huh?

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:20.792
No.

00:15:20.792 --> 00:15:23.125
Accounts do exist.

00:15:23.125 --> 00:15:26.167
Accounts far more powerful
in terms of level and equipment

00:15:26.167 --> 00:15:30.125
than the default accounts
being used by the enemy.

00:15:30.125 --> 00:15:31.625
Wh-Where are they?

00:15:31.625 --> 00:15:38.000
The very accounts you're
logged in with at this moment!

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:39.917
Data conversion!

00:15:39.917 --> 00:15:44.333
All of you, as well as scores
of other VRMMO players

00:15:44.333 --> 00:15:50.542
must convert the characters that you've trained
throughout the Seed worlds into Underworld accounts.

00:15:50.542 --> 00:15:53.167
I get it! Never thought of that!

00:15:53.167 --> 00:15:58.167
That said, this particular method
does have a few problems.

00:15:58.917 --> 00:16:01.792
"Tuesday, July 7, 2026 5:02 AM
ALO Neutral City Arun"

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:07.417
This is neither a lie or a joke.

00:16:07.417 --> 00:16:14.208
Soon, tens of thousands of American players
will unknowingly dive into the Underworld,

00:16:14.208 --> 00:16:18.750
a virtual world based on the Seed
created by a certain Japanese research company,

00:16:18.750 --> 00:16:24.542
and they're going to massacre
everyone who lives there!

00:16:24.542 --> 00:16:28.500
The residents of the Underworld
aren't mere NPCs!

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:32.417
They share the same emotions and souls as us!

00:16:32.417 --> 00:16:36.708
Please lend us a hand to protect them!

00:16:36.708 --> 00:16:41.667
Everyone, please convert your existing
character data to the Underworld!

00:16:45.833 --> 00:16:53.292
Lisbeth, I know that you and your friends
wouldn't joke around this early in the day,

00:16:53.292 --> 00:16:57.667
and the fact that Kirito hasn't
logged in for more than ten days

00:16:57.667 --> 00:17:01.083
means this is no trivial matter. But...

00:17:01.083 --> 00:17:03.750
To be honest, I find it hard to believe.

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:09.792
AIs with the same souls as humans,
with the U.S. military out to seize them?

00:17:09.792 --> 00:17:12.583
Both scenarios are far too unrealistic.

00:17:12.583 --> 00:17:19.750
Moreover, didn't you also just say that there'd
be several problems with conversion?

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:23.708
Would you mind explaining
what those issues are first?

00:17:23.708 --> 00:17:25.417
Yes.

00:17:25.417 --> 00:17:27.958
The Underworld...

00:17:27.958 --> 00:17:32.000
...isn't being operated
as a normal VRMMO game.

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:36.167
Which is why diving into it
will present some problems.

00:17:37.208 --> 00:17:42.375
First of all, the Underworld
has no operational UI.

00:17:42.375 --> 00:17:46.125
In other words, you can't log out
of your own accord.

00:17:47.083 --> 00:17:51.417
The only way to log out is to "die" in-game.

00:17:51.417 --> 00:17:55.125
But that would trigger yet another problem.

00:17:55.125 --> 00:18:00.208
The Underworld has no built-in pain absorber.

00:18:00.208 --> 00:18:03.083
If you take enough damage
to drop your HP to zero,

00:18:03.083 --> 00:18:06.083
you're likely to feel
the most excruciating pain.

00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:09.875
And finally...

00:18:09.875 --> 00:18:15.167
...at this time, the developers are unable
to operate the Underworld.

00:18:15.167 --> 00:18:18.625
Which means that once you've
converted your character data,

00:18:18.625 --> 00:18:22.833
there's no guarantee it can be
converted back to the original game.

00:18:22.833 --> 00:18:27.417
In some cases, it may even
end up in character loss.

00:18:27.417 --> 00:18:28.417
Hold on a second.

00:18:28.417 --> 00:18:29.375
What's up with that?

00:18:29.375 --> 00:18:30.125
Loss?

00:18:30.125 --> 00:18:31.375
Give me a break!

00:18:31.375 --> 00:18:34.333
D-Don't give us that!

00:18:34.333 --> 00:18:35.792
Character loss, you say?

00:18:35.792 --> 00:18:38.333
So if they're lost,
are you guys going to make good?

00:18:38.333 --> 00:18:42.000
Or is this just a trap to weaken us,
tribe by tribe?

00:18:43.042 --> 00:18:46.917
I'm sorry! We won't be able to compensate you.

00:18:46.917 --> 00:18:53.250
We're keenly aware that money can't buy
the characters you've raised until now!

00:18:53.250 --> 00:18:57.333
That's why we're pleading with you! To help us.

00:18:57.333 --> 00:19:01.833
To help our friends who are desperately
fending off the American attack

00:19:01.833 --> 00:19:04.625
in the Underworld, even as we speak!

00:19:04.625 --> 00:19:09.250
These friends you're talking about,
you mean SAO survivors, don't you?

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:15.958
You can't fool us! We know that you former SAO
players all secretly look down on the rest of us!

00:19:15.958 --> 00:19:19.333
What do we care about invasions,
artificial intelligence, or souls!

00:19:19.333 --> 00:19:23.625
Don't waste our time with all this talk
about bringing the real world into a VRMMO!

00:19:23.625 --> 00:19:26.667
You guys can deal with
that kind of thing yourselves!

00:19:26.667 --> 00:19:30.167
Just you survivors,
celebrated even in real life!

00:19:36.208 --> 00:19:37.917
It didn't work.

00:19:37.917 --> 00:19:42.083
My words weren't enough
to get through to them at all.

00:20:12.625 --> 00:20:15.583
That's right, this is happening
in the real world!

00:20:16.833 --> 00:20:23.292
Like you said, those of us who came from SAO might have
the tendency to blur what's real and what's virtual!

00:20:23.292 --> 00:20:29.958
But I swear to you, we don't think of ourselves
as heroes, or anything special!

00:20:29.958 --> 00:20:32.250
This girl and I...

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:35.583
...we attend a school made up of only survivors.

00:20:35.583 --> 00:20:41.042
The students there have to undergo counseling
once a month, no matter what.

00:20:41.042 --> 00:20:43.750
We get asked all these uncomfortable questions.

00:20:43.750 --> 00:20:48.083
And they make a lot of kids take meds
against their will.

00:20:48.083 --> 00:20:54.125
We're all part of the government's
potential criminal watch list.

00:20:54.125 --> 00:20:59.292
And it's not just the students at the returnee
school who are being treated that way.

00:21:00.292 --> 00:21:05.917
All VRMMO players are looked upon
that way, more or less.

00:21:05.917 --> 00:21:09.208
As if we're dead weight
that doesn't contribute to society.

00:21:09.208 --> 00:21:13.042
People who refuse to face up to reality,
not paying taxes or social security.

00:21:13.042 --> 00:21:15.792
Some people even argue
that the military draft should be reinstated,

00:21:15.792 --> 00:21:19.000
so we can be forced to serve.

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:22.542
But there's one thing I know! And I believe it!

00:21:22.542 --> 00:21:26.833
That reality is right here!

00:21:28.875 --> 00:21:33.792
This world, as well as
the countless virtual worlds connected to it,

00:21:33.792 --> 00:21:37.125
in no way are they make-believe refuges!

00:21:37.125 --> 00:21:41.750
For me, this world is the reality
where I have a real life,

00:21:41.750 --> 00:21:46.625
real friends, real encounters and partings,
and real smiles and tears!

00:21:46.625 --> 00:21:48.458
Don't you all feel the same way?

00:21:48.458 --> 00:21:53.667
Aren't you all doing your best
because this world is your alternate reality?

00:21:53.667 --> 00:21:56.417
And yet, if it's just a game,

00:21:56.417 --> 00:22:00.167
if you abandon it
because it's nothing but a virtual fake,

00:22:00.167 --> 00:22:04.208
then tell me, where is our truth?

00:22:07.083 --> 00:22:14.167
All these worlds that we've grown came together
just like this World Tree and started to bud.

00:22:15.125 --> 00:22:18.500
And caused this flower called
the Underworld to bloom.

00:22:18.500 --> 00:22:21.375
Well, I want to protect it.

00:22:21.375 --> 00:22:23.792
Please!

00:22:23.792 --> 00:22:27.333
Please... help us.

00:22:57.042 --> 00:22:59.708
"Dark Territory Northern Chasm"

00:23:03.833 --> 00:23:06.292
All right! On to the sixth rope!

00:23:48.167 --> 00:23:52.192
Next time: "Ray of Light."
